1. Her streaming purpose is to help people who feel lonely and sad, especially those like her younger self. (Verbatim: "I stream for people like little elia like me when i was like younger just sag alone dark room world sucks kind of feeling and wanting to make it feel like we're not so it's not so bad that's all.")

